This repository is licensed per component. Each source file carries an
SPDX-License-Identifier header. The full licence texts are in LICENSES/.

CC0-1.0 (LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt)
  tools/SPEC.md            OpenBook Rich format specification
  results/*.json           aggregated analysis figures

MIT (LICENSES/MIT.txt)
  tools/obr.py             reference reader
  tools/obr_tobin.py       .obr -> Polyglot .bin export
  tools/build_obr.py       .obr builder
  tools/ctgscan.py         CTG page scanner
  tools/compare_obr.py     .obr comparison (C++ vs Python check)

GPL-3.0-or-later (LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt)
  tools/ctg_movetable.py   move table derived from jja 0.9.1 (Ali Polatel)
  tools/ctglib.py          CTG codec, index lookup, move decoding
  tools/ctgwalk.py         CTG tree walk
  tools/gen_aliases.py     alias generation
  tools/test_codec.py      codec checks
  tools/test_flip.py       mirroring-rule checks
  tools/ctg2obr.cpp        C++ CTG -> .obr converter (contains the jja move table)

The GPL files are the ones that import ctg_movetable.py, directly or through
ctglib.py, and ctg2obr.cpp, which contains the same table. The MIT and CC0
files do not import any GPL file.

